# Fixtures are compared byte for byte, so git must not rewrite them.
#
# The root .gitattributes forces `eol=lf` on everything, which is right for
# source and wrong here: one fixture carries a `\r\n` body on purpose, to prove
# that this loader keeps a body exactly as written. `-text` on the whole
# directory stops git from touching any fixture's line endings.
* -text
